    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d381">

                <pb facs="0442" n="392" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg392"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr.
                            Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-02-24"><hi rendition="#italic">February 24,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to say with reference to your note
                    of the 15th ultimo that, as I learn by a letter of the 20th instant from the
                    governor of Texas, Rómulo Sanchez was discharged from jail more than a month
                    previous to the date of his letter. He adds, “At no time was any question raised
                    as to the jurisdiction of the court by reason of the land in litigation being
                    foreign territory.”</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
